OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning with patchy
OL,6,Flight rain and drizzle. This easing by
OL,7,Flunchtime with most places becoming
OL,8,Fdry. A few brighter interludes
OL,9,Fdeveloping in the north and perhaps
OL,10,Fmore widely this afternoon. Feeling a
OL,11,Fbit colder than yesterday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSkies continuing to clear
OL,14,Fthis evening and remaining clear
OL,15,Fovernight. Quickly turning cold with a
OL,16,Fwidespread and locally sharp frost
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Patchy freezing fog
OL,18,Fdeveloping in the countryside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
