OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cold and frosty start for
OL,6,Fmost with any freezing fog gradually
OL,7,Fclearing through the morning.
OL,8,FOtherwise a largely sunny albeit
OL,9,Fchilly day with a freshening easterly
OL,10,Fbreeze later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,13,Fcloudier day on Sunday but probably
OL,14,Fremaining mostly dry. Turning more
OL,15,Fchangeable into next week with spells
OL,16,Fof windier and wetter weather. Slowly
OL,17,Fbecoming a bit milder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
